/*
 * InstructionExpander — expands instruction-level semantic nodes into YIL instructions.
 *
 * The InstructionExpander lowers high-level control-flow and instruction constructs into
 * concrete YIL instructions. It handles:
 *
 *   - variable declarations,
 *   - break and continue,
 *   - return (inline-aware),
 *   - throw and panic,
 *   - implicit destructor scheduling for movable values,
 *   - lazy variable initialization,
 *   - reference variable initialization.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lint::expander::value::instr
 * @File: ymirc/lint/expander/value/instr.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-23
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
